  "body": "Earlier today our database server restarted. The database recovered itself; Synapse did not. In particular we saw \"in flight requests\" stacking up:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1389908/138571705-ba1c0748-cfe7-4e4f-8d86-87d32eb3dc51.png)\r\n\r\n... and the reverse-proxy returned 429s for many requests.",
